legend [shape=plaintext, fontsize=11, label="Curated134 receptor-geometry baseline; refinement12 gains not installed\nModule links bundle actual edges; within-module edges are in expanded panels/tables.\nArrow: saved excitatory category. Open circle: saved inhibitory category.\nNeuron colours: RG blue; PF green; motor salmon; afferent purple.\nDashed pentagons: boundary references, not additional neurons.\nEdge numbers: gmax (uS). Full fields and IDs accompany each panel."];
